<title>UK: SmithKline Q1 new product sales up 40 pct.</title>
<headline>SmithKline Q1 new product sales up 40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>SmithKline Beecham said on Tuesday first-quarter sales of its new products rose 40 percent to 354 million stg.</p>
<p>The drugs group earlier said pre-tax profits for the three months to March 31 rose eight percent to 418 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
